00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.580
CS:GO is a game played in split second bursts.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.920
Rounds often come down to the final bullet,

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.420
(Casting)

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.200
Or a last second defuse,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.000
and when you find yourself in that situation, and your team comes out on top.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.660
Well sometimes there's only one thing left to say, Nice!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.180
Now guys it isn't all about the hardcore intense situations either.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:34.140
